  },
  "question": {
    "text": "A body is projected from the ground with some speed at some angle with the horizontal. Taking the horizontal and vertical direction to be <math><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi>y</mi></math> axes respectively and the point of projection as origin, calculate the minimum speed (in <math><msup><mrow><mi>m s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>) of projection so that&nbsp;it can pass through a point whose <math><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi>y</mi></math> coordinates are <math><mn>30 m</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi></mi></math> and <math><mn>40 m</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi></mi></math> respectively? Take <math><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi></mi><msup><mrow><mi>m s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "30",
  "solution": {
    "text": "In projectile motion, the equation of the trajectory is<br /><br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Substituting the given values, we have<br /><br /><math><mn>40</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />or <math><mn>900</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>900</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />The value of <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></math> will be real if<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>900</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>900</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />or <math><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>100</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>900</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />or <math><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>800</mn><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>90000</mn></math><br /><br />or <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>400</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>160000</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>90000</mn></math><br /><br />or <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>400</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>250000</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>900</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>30</mn></math>&nbsp;<math><mi></mi><msup><mrow><mi>m s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
  }
}